# Verification skill stays in sync

You are on Verification paths. Product facts an agent cannot infer live in
`.claude/skills/verification-mytrion/SKILL.md` (canonical; mirrored to `.cursor/skills/`).

If this change touches **tabs, gates, phases, routes, vendors, or which store a write hits**,
update that skill in the **same PR** (both mirrors, byte-identical). Read the skill before
editing Verification UI or APIs. SOP vs code disagreements stay stated — do not silently pick.

Do not invent CS / Billing workspace skills. Do not restyle `MytrionShell` sidebar/header.
Do not call credit_platform / loans from the CRM. The live desk is `/verification/flow/*`,
not the Sales verification tab and not the quarantined Decision Desk.
